        "subject": "LU-6142 llite: number LLIF_* flags implicitly",
        "message": "LU-6142 llite: number LLIF_* flags implicitly\n\nThe LLIF_* values are in-memory bit numbers for lli_flags, so\nthey do not need explicit values.  Removing them lets patches\nadd new flags without conflicting on the last enum entry.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I20959bec7bc346e5fb487a77205bcab1253ebbe5\n"
      },
